<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: GOLF-CZECH OPEN LEADING FIRST ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-CZECH OPEN LEADING FIRST ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading positions from the first round of the Czech Open golf tournament on Thursday (British unless stated):</p>
