<p>(Sweden), Lee Westwood, Anders Forsbrand (Sweden),</p>
<p>Carl Suneson (Spain), Massimo Florioli (Italy),</p>
<p>Miguel Angel Jiminez (Spain), Wayne Riley</p>
<p>(Australia), Derrick Cooper, Andrew Oldcorn</p>
<p>68 Stephen Gallacher, Domingo Hospital (Spain), Jose</p>
<p>Rivero (Spain), Greg Turner (New Zealand), Santiago</p>
<p>Luna (Spain), David Howell, Rolf Muntz (Netherlands),</p>
<p>Joakim Rask (Sweden), Tony Johnstone (Zimbabwe),</p>
<p>Jamie Spence, Stephen Field, Phillip Price, Fredrik</p>
<p>Jacobson (Sweden), Bob May (U.S.), Clinton Whitelaw</p>
<p>(South Africa).</p>
